# The api/ingest/worker images build from the repo root, so Docker reads THIS file, not
# apps/api/.dockerignore. Without it every .venv ships in the context (~450 MB, minutes per build).
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite

.git
.github
docs
data/raw
data/reports
data/synthetic
*.md
